# Manual reads only. Start no host from this file.
# Review ../WALKTHROUGH.md before using an approved development environment.
@api = https://localhost:7001

### Unchanged model seed includes Royal Villa, ID 1.
GET {{api}}/api/v1/VillaAPI/1
Accept: application/json

### V1 occupancy filter and repository pagination.
GET {{api}}/api/v1/VillaAPI?filterOccupancy=4&pageSize=2&pageNumber=1
Accept: application/json

### Equivalent V2 collection route.
GET {{api}}/api/v2/VillaAPI?filterOccupancy=4&pageSize=2&pageNumber=1
Accept: application/json

### ID zero takes the explicit bad-request branch.
GET {{api}}/api/v1/VillaAPI/0
Accept: application/json
